---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Open Source" description="Independent open-source software projects by Nick Roust.">
  <div class="legacy-content open-source-page">
    <p>Independent projects with public source code and Apache License 2.0 repositories.</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Fake-bank</h2>
        <p>An open-source payment provider simulator for local integration testing. It includes an API, hosted checkout, webhook delivery, deterministic scenarios, and PostgreSQL persistence.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/nick-roust/fake-bank" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source repository (Apache 2.0) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>fake-shop</h2>
        <p>An open-source reference commerce application for local demos and checkout integration experiments. Its default mock checkout and state are browser-local.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/nick-roust/fake-shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source repository (Apache 2.0) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
